--- SubDyn-Hydrodyn Driver file 
Compatible with Openfast v4.0.4
TRUE           Echo           - Echo the input file data (flag)
---------------------- ENVIRONMENTAL CONDITIONS -------------------------------------------------
    9.80665   Gravity             - Gravity (m/s^2)
       1025   WtrDens             - Water density (kg/m^3)
        150   WtrDpth             - Water depth (m)
          0   MSL2SWL             - Offset between still-water level and mean sea level (m) [positive upward]
---------------------- SubDyn -------------------------------------------------------------------
"VolturnUS_SubDyn_platform.dat"       SDInputFile    - Absolute or relative path.
"VolturnUS_SubDyn_platform"           OutRootName    - Basename for output files.
1000                            NSteps         - Number of time steps in the simulations (-)
0.01                          TimeInterval   - TimeInterval for the simulation (sec)
0.0   0.0   0.0                  TP_RefPoint    - Location of the TP reference point in global coordinates (m)
0.0                            SubRotateZ     - Rotation angle of the structure geometry in degrees about the global Z axis.   
---------------------- HydroDyn -------------------------------------------------------------------
1                         HDFlag    - Enable or disable inclusion of HydroDyn added mass in SubDyn (1-enable or 0-disable)
"./VolturnUS_HydroDyn_strip_theory.dat"    HDInputFile       - Primary HydroDyn input file name (quoted string)
"SeaState.dat"    SeaStateInputFile       - Primary SeaState input file name (quoted string)
---------------------- PRP INPUTS (Platform Reference Point) ------------------
          0   PRPInputsMod      - Model for the PRP (principal reference point) inputs {0: all inputs are zero for every timestep, 1: steadystate inputs, 2: read inputs from a file (InputsFile)} (switch)
END of driver input file
